4
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,380
Others will only think

5
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,440
It was picked up from the ruins.

6
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:18,520
What do you want to change?

7
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,520
