10
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:22,520
There are also some stainless steel

11
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:23,520
About five hundred kilograms

12
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,520
Can you find someone to check for acceptance?

13
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,520
what did you say

14
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,520
The house is too complicated

15
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,520
Yes, it's on the truck at the door.

16
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,520
