30
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:45,970
much higher price

31
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:49,420
A total of more than 3.8 million points

32
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:50,420
Should these be replaced too?

33
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:51,420
Get it all together

34
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:53,420
Four million points girl

35
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:54,420
Your worth

36
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:55,420
It's enough to spend a long time at the base without any worries.
